# Never bake runtime state or secrets into the image.
# *.db in particular: a developer running `python app.py` locally creates
# docid_cache.db here, and COPY . . would otherwise ship their cache as
# production reference data.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env
.env.*
.git
tests/
requirements-dev.txt
ANALYSIS.md
